    "slideId": "1l7r0u",
    "text": "Approved plan: docs/code/Missions/LAB/approved-plan.txt. Architecture: docs/architecture/lab-manager/README.md. Operator guide: lab-manager/README.md. This additive host manager does not complete the separate M2a research-runtime program. All execution uses our infrastructure. Linux GPU, ARM64/Spark and configured actual model execution remain qualification work. Compose rendering: lab-manager/src/ai4r_lab_manager/compose.py. Native editable image entrypoint: deploy/lab-manager/lab-entrypoint.sh. CC names are selection metadata; installation/enabling remains native configuration.\nCurrent phase amended: DESIGN FOR APPROVAL. No further Lab Manager implementation requested. Prior prototype evidence is historical and does not constitute design approval."
